# Links made at the first question under ids that grow by one: nearly every store goes to the list's own length, and the vector has room. The id is `anything` by type, so the key is boxed, and the
# store of a proven list under any key stored in line only under the public length: all the rest went through the cached stub to the store by any key. Inside the vector the length is raised in
# line, as the stores under an integer do.
